sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant API as "erp-api<br/>CommandOrderControllerV1<br/>(vars: createOrderCommand:CreateOrderCommand, productId:String, id:String, reason:String, status:String)"
    participant App as "erp-application<br/>CreateOrderUseCase.execute(CreateOrderCommand)<br/>UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(UpdateOrderStatusCommand)<br/>CancelOrderUseCase.execute(CancelOrderCommand)"
    participant Domain as "erp-domain<br/>OrderRoot (Order aggregate)<br/>extends AggregateRoot<OrderId> -> Entity<OrderId]<br/>OrderItem extends Entity<OrderItemId]"
    participant Infra as "erp-infrastructure<br/>OrderRepository (implements ProductCatalogRepositoryPort / OrderCatalogRepositoryPort)"
    participant Common as "erp-common<br/>Commands: CreateOrderCommand(OrderItemRequest)/CancelOrderCommand/UpdateOrderStatusCommand"

    Note over API,App: Crear orden (POST)
    Client->>API: POST /commands/orders { CreateOrderCommand } <br/> POST /commands/orders { CreateOrderCommand } <br/> POST /commands/orders { createOrderCommand: CreateOrderCommand }
    API->>Common: validar/request mapping <br/>: validar/mapear -> createOrderCommand (CreateOrderCommand with items: List<OrderItemRequest>)
    API->>App: CreateOrderUseCase.execute(CreateOrderCommand) <br/>API->>App: CreateOrderUseCase.execute(createOrderCommand)
    App->>Domain: OrderFactory.create(...) -> OrderAggregate <br/>App->>Domain: OrderRoot.create(orderNumber, customer, items -> List<OrderItem>)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderAggregate) <br/> OrderRepository.save(orderRoot)  
    Infra-->>Domain: persisted Order id <br/> persisted Order id (OrderId / String)
    Domain-->>App: OrderAggregate (con id) <br/> orderRoot (with id)
    App-->>API: retorna id <br/> returns productId (String)
    API-->>Client: 201 Created Location: /commands/orders/{id} <br/> 201 Created Location: /commands/orders/{productId}

    Note over API,App: Cancelar orden (PATCH /{id}/cancel)
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/cancel?reason=... <br/> PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/cancel?reason={reason}
    API->>App: CancelOrderUseCase.execute(CancelOrderCommand) <br/> CancelOrderUseCase.execute(new CancelOrderCommand(id, reason))
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: OrderAggregate \n orderRoot
    App->>Domain: OrderAggregate.cancel(reason) \n orderRoot.cancel(reason)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderAggregate) \n OrderRepository.save(orderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    Note over API,App: Actualizar estado (PATCH /{id}/status)
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/status?status=SHIPPED <br/> PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/status?status={status}
    API->>App: UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(UpdateOrderStatusCommand) <br/> UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(new UpdateOrderStatusCommand(id, status))
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: OrderAggregate <br/>

    App->>Domain: OrderAggregate.updateStatus(newStatus) <br/> orderRoot.<transition> (confirm/ship/deliver based on status)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(OrderAggregate) <br/> OrderRepository.save(orderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content
